\section{Unfinished Business}
\begin{enumerate}
\item Bylaws amendment (information only): introduced in July and approved by the Council in August; to be
presented to the Residents Association in December.
\item Hand‑sanitizer dispensers at trash rooms (from prior discussion): No installations planned due to
cost/maintenance; residents/helpers advised to wash hands after disposing of trash.
\end{enumerate}

\section{New Business}
\begin{enumerate}
\item Officer elections: Conducted per bylaws at the September open meeting; single nominees for all offices; floor
nominations invited and none offered; officers declared elected without ballot.
\begin{itemize}
\item President: Luke Yackley
\item Vice President: Rich Compton
\item Treasurer: Jim Devine
\item Secretary: George Wright
\item Administrative Assistant: Joanna Hill-Devine
\end{itemize}
\end{enumerate}

\section{Questions from the Floor}
\begin{enumerate}
\item Apartment door nameplates: current temporary names are not permanent; a facility-wide signage project
($\sim 900$ signs) is in design with a vendor.
\item “Clerk” reference clarified: a record‑keeping application for rosters/committee membership.
\item Renovations: second‑floor plans to be presented Sept 29 (schematic set; detailed design in progress).
\item Shannon 6th-floor lamps: need for outlets and bulbs; Facilities to add outlets and ensure bulbs.
\item Shannon 4th-floor post-construction dust/debris: Environmental Services to vacuum/clean.
\item Bus replacement: four proposals received; trade-in planned; build time $\sim 6$--9 months after order.
\end{enumerate}

